      "body": "## Summary\n\n- Forward the target model's explicit `hf_token` when constructing the draft `ModelConfig` for speculative decoding.\n- Extend the existing MTP draft-config regression test to verify that the authentication token is inherited.\n\nThis fixes private Hugging Face draft-model configurations that otherwise lose the target model's explicit token during construction.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Focused configuration tests: 33 passed.\n- Ruff, formatting, typo, SPDX, lazy-import, forbidden-import, CUDA API, configuration, boolean-context, and `git diff --check` validations passed.\n- GPU execution and model evaluation were not run because this change only propagates a configuration value before model execution.\n\nI used AI assistance to investigate this issue and prepare the tests, then\nreviewed the implementation and test results before submission.\n",
